  "notes": "{一変|いっぺん} combines {一|いち} (one, single) and {変|へん} (change), conveying the sense of \"changing in one stroke.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {状況|じょうきょう}が{一変|いっぺん}する (the situation changes completely)\n- {人生|じんせい}が{一変|いっぺん}する (one's life is transformed)\n- {雰囲気|ふんいき}が{一変|いっぺん}する (the atmosphere changes completely)\n- {景色|けしき}が{一変|いっぺん}する (the scenery changes completely)\n- {一変|いっぺん}させる (to transform completely — transitive)\n\nUSAGE:\n- Almost always used as a する verb: {一変|いっぺん}する\n- Emphasizes the completeness and abruptness of the change\n- Common in news and written narratives describing turning points",
